 "steps": [
  {
   "id": "s0",
   "title": "Before the explosion",
   "text": "A body of mass \\( m_1 + m_2 \\) is at rest, so its total momentum is **zero**. Inside it, a spring or an explosive is about to push it into two pieces.",
   "actions": [
    {
     "set": {
      "lv": 0,
      "ph": 0,
      "m1": 3,
      "m2": 6,
      "p": 4.8
     },
     "at": 0
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "s1",
   "title": "Pieces fly apart",
   "text": "The pieces move in **opposite** directions. The light piece moves faster than the heavy one.",
   "actions": [
    {
     "set": {
      "lv": 1,
      "m1": 3,
      "m2": 6,
      "p": 4.8
     },
     "at": 0
    },
    {
     "tween": {
      "ph": 1
     },
     "at": 0,
     "dur": 3500
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "s2",
   "title": "Momentum balance",
   "text": "No external force acts, so the total momentum stays zero: \\( m_1v_1 - m_2v_2 = 0 \\). With \\( m_1 = 3 \\) kg, \\( v_1 = {{v1|1}} \\) m s⁻¹ and \\( m_2 = 6 \\) kg: \\( v_2 = {{v2|1}} \\) m s⁻¹.",
   "actions": [
    {
     "set": {
      "lv": 2,
      "ph": 1,
      "m1": 3,
      "m2": 6,
      "p": 4.8
     },
     "at": 0
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "s3",
   "title": "Kinetic energy appears",
   "text": "Before the explosion KE was zero; now it is \\( {{K1|2}} + {{K2|2}} \\) J. Momentum is conserved but kinetic energy is **not**: it came from stored energy.",
   "actions": [
    {
     "set": {
      "lv": 3,
      "ph": 1,
      "m1": 3,
      "m2": 6,
      "p": 4.8
     },
     "at": 0
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "s4",
   "title": "Light and heavy",
   "text": "Make piece 1 only 1 kg: it flies off at \\( {{v1|1}} \\) m s⁻¹ with most of the energy, while the heavy piece creeps away.",
